    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύ̄λ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>converting into juice</i> or <i>chyle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τῆς τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.700b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>thickening of a juice by decoction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				109
			</span></i>.</div>
